UAC-0063 targeted a Ukrainian state agency using phishing emails masquerading as the Embassy of Tajikistan in Ukraine. The attack chain deployed HATVIBE, which dropped LOGPIE and CHERRYSPY, while STILLARCH was used for data exfiltration.

